  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the following statements in respect of the function $f(x)=x^{3}-1, x \\in[-1,1]$\r\n\r\nI. $f(x)$ is increasing in [-1,1] \r\n\r\nII. $f(x)$ has no root in (-1,1) . \r\n\r\nWhich of the statements given above is/are correct?",
    "image": null
